Hi {{trigger.payload.data.name}},

Thank you for contacting us! We've received your inquiry and will get back to you soon.

**Your Inquiry:**
- Type: {{trigger.payload.data.inquiryType}}
- Subject: {{trigger.payload.data.subject}}
- Urgency: {{trigger.payload.data.urgency || 'Medium'}}

**What happens next?**
- We'll review your inquiry within 24 hours
- Our team will respond via your preferred contact method: {{trigger.payload.data.preferredContact}}
- For urgent matters, we'll prioritize your request

**Your Message:**
{{trigger.payload.data.message}}

If you have any questions in the meantime, feel free to reach out.

Best regards,
The Team

**URGENT INQUIRY RECEIVED**

**Contact:**
- Name: {{trigger.payload.data.name}}
- Email: {{trigger.payload.data.email}}
- Phone: {{trigger.payload.data.phone || 'Not provided'}}
- Preferred Contact: {{trigger.payload.data.preferredContact}}

**Inquiry:**
- Type: {{trigger.payload.data.inquiryType}}
- Subject: {{trigger.payload.data.subject}}
- Urgency: URGENT

**Message:**
{{trigger.payload.data.message}}

**Action Required:**
Please respond to this inquiry immediately.

